#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Refresh README.md with a live status card (assets/status-*.svg).

The card is a desert-at-dusk scene: two moons in the corner, the last 30 days
of contributions drawn as a dune, and wind-blown sand drifting across it.
Run with --test to render sample data into ./test-out/ without a token.
"""

